303	     * string when absent) and the {@link #soundex(String) soundex} of the last name, joined by {@code '|'} in
304	     * that order before hashing. Mixing in the {@code 'V2'} tag makes the key disjoint from every version-1
305	     * key. This is the single 64-hex key used for duplicate detection, so the value returned here matches the
306	     * one the create endpoint compares.
