478	     * <ul>
479	     *   <li>the owner is a possible duplicate ({@code possibleDuplicate} is {@code true});</li>
480	     *   <li>the owner's email domain is {@link #disposableAdjacent(String) disposable-adjacent};</li>
481	     *   <li>the owner's city is over its soft capacity ({@code capacityWarning} is {@code true}).</li>
482	     * </ul>
