### Routing summary
The path is assembled from two pieces: the class-level `@RequestMapping("/api")` on the controller plus the interface's `@RequestMapping(method = POST, value = "/owners")`. The controller implements the OpenAPI-generated `OwnersApi` interface, whose `addOwner` operation carries the actual HTTP mapping and the `@Valid @RequestBody` trigger. The handler body lives in `OwnerRestControllerV1`. (`OwnerRestControllerV2` only adds a paginated GET `listOwnersPage`; it has no create.)

