### Exact order of validations and side-effects in `addOwner`

1. `@PreAuthorize("hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)")` — authorization (403 if missing).
2. Bean Validation on `OwnerFieldsDto` via `@Valid` (`@NotNull`/`@Pattern`/`@Size`/`@Email`) — 400 on failure, before the body runs.
3. Idempotency replay: read `Idempotency-Key` header; if seen, return the original owner (200) via `findOwnerById`.
4. `rejectMissingOrBlankFields` — null/blank firstName, lastName, city, telephone, and address-in-either-form → `RequiredFieldsMissingException` (400).
5. `ownerMapper.toOwner(dto)` — map DTO → `Owner` (id & pets ignored).
6. `applyAddress` — prefer structured `addressLine1/2`, normalize (upper-case, collapse whitespace, expand ST/RD/AVE), compose flat `address`.
7. `normalizeTelephone` → E.164; invalid → `InvalidTelephoneException` (400).
8. `normalizeEmail` — if present, syntactic check (`InvalidEmailException`, 400), lower-case, then disposable-domain block (`DisposableEmailDomainException`, 400).
9. `validatePostcode` — if present, 4 digits and in region range → else `InvalidPostcodeException` (400).
10. `rejectFutureRegistrationDate` — supplied date after today → `FutureRegistrationDateException` (400).
11. Default `registrationDate` to `LocalDate.now()` if null, then `rollToBusinessDay` (skip weekends + fixed 2026 public holidays).
12. `rejectDailyLimitReached` — ≥100 owners already on that date → `DailyOwnerLimitExceededException` (429).
13. `rejectCityAtCapacity` — ≥50 owners in city (case-insensitive) → `CityOwnerLimitExceededException` (409).
14. `computeHouseholdId` — SHA-256 of `V2|normalizedLastName|postcode`, first 12 hex.
15. `rejectDuplicateIdentity` — exact `identityKey` match against non-deleted owners → `DuplicateIdentityException` (409).
16. `assignPossibleDuplicate` — soft duplicate by last-name soundex + exact postcode (skipped if `sharesHousehold` or no postcode); sets `possibleDuplicate`/`possibleDuplicateOf`.
17. `generateMemberId` — `<REGIONV2><FY><HASH8><LuhnCheck>`, de-duplicated with `-n` suffix (reads all owners' memberIds).
18. `countNamesakes`, `countHouseholdSize`, `computeMembershipLevel` (with household ceiling), `isBulkSignupDay` (>80/day), `isCityApproachingCapacity` (40-49) — all set derived fields (each re-reads `findAllOwners`).
19. `clinicService.saveOwner(owner)` — `@Transactional` persist via `ownerRepository.save`; entity-level Bean Validation (`@NotEmpty`, telephone `@Pattern`) runs at flush.
20. Record idempotency key → new owner id.
21. `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto(owner)` — builds response (displayName, initials, salutation, fiscalYear, membershipPoints/Level, locality, timezone, contactPreference, ageBand, identity{memberId, householdId, identityKey}, telephoneDisplay, selfLink, ownerSegment, riskFlag).
22. Side-effects: `AUDIT.info(...)` human line; `emitOwnerCreatedEvent` (schema-v2 JSON to AUDIT logger with a process-wide sequence number); `enqueueWelcomeNotification` (line to NOTIFY logger). These are log emissions, not Spring events.
